; The export list of amdhip64.dll for step 2 of M16 (design docs/design/m16-hip-route-b.md,
; section 4.1). One name per line, no decoration: every HIP entry point is extern "C", so the
; exported name equals the C name on x64 Windows.
;
; 38 names. build-runtime.ps1 counts them, and it compares this list with the exports of the
; built DLL. The import library amdhip64.lib comes from this file through llvm-dlltool, and its
; name must be exactly amdhip64.lib, because clang's HIP driver appends that name to the
; Windows link line by itself.
LIBRARY amdhip64.dll
EXPORTS
__hipPopCallConfiguration
__hipPushCallConfiguration
__hipRegisterFatBinary
__hipRegisterFunction
__hipRegisterManagedVar
__hipRegisterVar
__hipUnregisterFatBinary
hipDeviceSynchronize
hipEventCreate
hipEventCreateWithFlags
hipEventDestroy
hipEventElapsedTime
hipEventRecord
hipEventSynchronize
hipFree
hipGetDevice
hipGetDeviceCount
hipGetDeviceProperties
hipGetErrorName
hipGetErrorString
hipGetLastError
hipHostFree
hipHostMalloc
hipInit
hipLaunchKernel
hipMalloc
hipMemGetInfo
hipMemcpy
hipMemcpyAsync
hipMemset
hipMemsetAsync
hipPeekAtLastError
hipSetDevice
hipStreamCreate
hipStreamCreateWithFlags
hipStreamDestroy
hipStreamSynchronize
hipStreamWaitEvent
